      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That dull ache in your jaw and neck could certainly be related to tension or stress, which is a very common culprit. Sometimes, poor posture or clenching your jaw without realizing it can cause these muscular aches. Since your chest feels fine, a simple muscle tension headache is a likely possibility, but if it persists, you might want to try some gentle stretching or consider reaching out to a professional.",
      "source": "target",
